WEBVTT

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:05.800
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.100
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:24.060
If I open this door, I'll find a new world

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:28.480
A world only just beginning

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:34.730
Even if there are tough times ahead

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:41.120
I'm sure I'll make it through

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:48.540
Now I'm making my way through this new world

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:54.860
And I've got hopes and dreams

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.700
I'm excited, I'm restless

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:01.220
Nobody can stop me

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:01.260
My heart is all fired up
Nobody can stop me

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:06.390
My heart is all fired up

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:10.420
From here I'll leap into the world

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:10.480
Taking to the sky
From here I'll leap into the world

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:13.610
Taking to the sky

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:19.680
Aiming for tomorrow and beyond

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:26.060
I believe that someday I'll grow up

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:31.080
That's why I'll spread my wings wide

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:54.750
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:56.910
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:56.910 --> 00:01:58.210
<i>And I'm Jasmine.</i>

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:03.380
<i>We're currently travelling to seven perilous places in order to recover the seven stolen gems!</i>

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:07.390
<i>We've already acquired the topaz,
ruby, opal, and the lapis lazuli!</i>

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:10.900
<i>We had to face some monsters, but they weren't anything we couldn't handle!</i>

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:16.900
<i>Hey now, we don't know what kinds of enemies we'll have to face in the future. You both need to be careful.</i>

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:19.500
<i>Geez, you worry too much, Barda!</i>

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:24.210
<i>And right now, we're headed to
Dread Mountain where the fifth gem is located!</i>

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:34.890
Wait! I said wait, Lief!

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.200
This mansion sure is old.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:57.810
Yeah, it somehow gives me the creeps.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:01.460
I'm really sorry, we haven't had
the time to clean the place up...

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:06.000
N-No, it's fine. Your mother lives here alone after all, right?

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:08.310
What's more, isn't she unwell?

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:09.700
Yes...

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:15.420
Let's get out of here as soon as we learn of the shortcut to Dread Mountain.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:16.600
Oh dear.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:21.200
You needn't be so reserved. We have
plenty of tea and cakes for you inside.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.620
I'm not being reserved!

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:27.680
I'm back, Mother! And I brought some guests with me as well!

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:29.510
Hold on, are you listening to me?!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.480
Mother!

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:39.210
What is this... The interior doesn't look any better.

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:40.110
Jasmine!

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:43.510
You keep being too harsh, Jasmine.

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:45.890
But...

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:49.990
This is a bit...

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:04.500
I'm sorry!

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:07.580
Closing that big door all of a sudden.

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.820
Ah, it's fine!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:15.050
Could you please wait there for a moment? I'm going to go and see my mother.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:19.250
I really do have a bad feeling about this after all...

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.710
Let's take a seat, Lief; we may as well.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:24.100
I guess you're right.

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:27.740
Hold on, don't either of you think that any of this is weird?!

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:31.600
Just how did she close that door from the second floor?!

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:34.100
That's just bizarre, isn't it?!

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:35.650
Geez!

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:37.700
You idiots!

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.240
Mama, I'm home!

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:44.700
We're home!

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:47.490
What took you so long? I was growing tired of waiting.

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:50.120
We're really sorry that we're late...

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:53.110
But, but, we've brought them here just like you asked!

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:54.900
Is that right? Good work.

00:04:55.070 --> 00:04:57.290
Yay! Mama praised me!

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:59.770
Me too, Mama! I really did my best back there too!

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:02.900
Me too! So please let me eat them, Mama!

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:05.250
Aaargh! Let's eat them! Let's eat them!!
Aaargh! Let's eat them! Let's eat them!!

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:08.710
What are you two on about?! Even though you tried to eat them on the way here...!

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:09.460
What?!

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:10.990
You two didn't even do anything!

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:12.990
Being a bag is really tiring, you know?!

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:15.010
That's enough out of you!

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:24.600
Really, what hopeless children you all are...

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:28.090
Now, bring those three to me.

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:33.600
I'll be sure to make them regret the
day that they were born on this earth.

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:42.210
That's it, this is creeping me out!

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:44.960
Let's hurry up and get out of this house!

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:48.780
We can't just leave without saying anything to Françoise, right?

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:52.210
And we still haven't heard anything about that shortcut.

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.300
I wonder what her mother is like...

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:57.360
Based on Françoise's story,
she seems to be a scary person...

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:59.000
Geez! I don't care anymore!!

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:03.890
God! I've had enough of this!

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:05.890
Are you alright, Jasmine?

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:10.500
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.700
Ah, how's your mother doing?

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:16.400
She seems to be doing well today!

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:18.120
Thank goodness!

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:21.600
She said that she wants to meet
and thank you all personally!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.300
Please, do come.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:32.900
If you're really that opposed to it, we can just leave after we hear about the shortcut.

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:34.400
Just a greeting won't hurt, right?

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.230
I've brought them, Mother.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:42.600
Come in.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:44.800
Please come in.

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:51.180
N-Nice to meet you. Uh, are you feeling well today?

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:54.300
Sorry?

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:58.370
Uh, are you feeling well today?

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:03.480
Do forgive me. I am hard of hearing these days.

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:07.980
I didn't think that she would be this old...

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:10.730
O-Old, she said...?!

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:15.630
Well then, would you guys mind
coming closer to my mother?

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:21.620
Thank you for going out of your
way to come to a place like this...

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.060
You should lie down, Mother!

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.520
Yes, please do, we don't mind.

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:35.580
Thank you for your kindness. And also, thank you very much for taking good care of my daughters.

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:37.200
'Daughters'?

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:46.060
I-I mean, did you not meet my other
children too on your way here?

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:49.810
No, Françoise was the only one we met.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:52.500
Oh, is that right?

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:58.990
Regardless, I heard that you defeated that scary sorceress, didn't you?

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.790
You mean, Thaegan?

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:02.990
How did you know about that?

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:06.500
Rumours of that sort travel fast, my dear.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:13.450
Can you come a little bit closer? I want to see the faces of the heroes who defeated that sorceress...

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:20.710
So, what did the sorceress look like?

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:27.200
She was very strong, but also very beautiful.

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:29.900
I see... beautiful, eh?

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:32.700
But she always had a really unpleasant expression.

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:38.800
That 'unpleasant expression'...

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:41.300
Did it look a little something like this?!

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:54.220
Françoise! So your mother was the
Sorceress Thaegan all along?!

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.860
That's right. Our Mama is pretty and strong,

00:08:57.740 --> 00:09:03.720
and so amazing that everyone's afraid of her!

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:08.140
Lief!

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:09.330
Damn you!

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:10.140
Lief!

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:12.600
Let him go!!

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:18.100
You fell into our trap, foolish humans!

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:20.140
I'm Tot!

00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:21.650
And I'm Hot!

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:23.500
My name is Fly!

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.190
And I am the Great Fie!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.000
Thaegan's children?!

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:34.480
See?! What I saw weren't illusions after all!

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:36.420
Now isn't the time for that...!

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:43.100
Really, what gluttonous children I have...

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:46.010
Can't you at least wait until I cook them?

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:47.210
Let's run, Lief!

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.350
Rae Ex, Thaegan!

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:01.620
They aren't pursuing us?!

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:02.460
Why?!

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:05.110
Anyway, let's get of this house now!

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:17.250
Hurry!

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:19.700
Come, let's go!

00:10:20.770 --> 00:10:24.310
I-It... doesn't connect to the outside...?!

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:29.540
That's impossible!

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:37.890
You're free to leave if you really want to, you know?

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:40.100
If you can, that is.

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:44.890
Barda! Let's look for another way out!

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:56.670
You'll never be able to escape from here.

00:10:56.670 --> 00:11:00.400
The three of you will be trapped in this mansion until the end of your days!

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:06.800
This mansion is my own magical creation, so there's no way for you to escape!

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:11.950
Now, my children, why don't we throw a party in celebration of my return?

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:12.500
Right!

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:13.460
Got it!

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:16.450
I'm going to gather as many crows as I can for you!

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:19.390
This party is going to be the best!

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:27.800
You three are fated to meet your end here!

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:31.810
It's no good.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.290
Shit! Even this won't work...?

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:40.830
That's why I told you that there was
something suspicious about Françoise.

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:43.870
I even said that we shouldn't enter this house!

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:49.830
Even though everything you were saying was true, we still didn't believe you. I'm sorry.

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:51.700
Forgive us, Jasmine.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:56.800
It's fine. We don't have the time to argue like Thaegan's children do, after all.

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:59.940
Anyway, let's keep looking for an exit!

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:06.360
Can we really get out of this place, I wonder...

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:10.100
That damned Thaegan... She's quite the vengeful sorceress.

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:20.510
I wonder if Kree is okay... Thaegan's children are out hunting for crows, aren't they?

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:24.090
I don't think he'd be so easily caught, but...

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:42.500
Kree!

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:48.800
Thank goodness you're alright!

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:52.820
What did he say?

00:12:53.200 --> 00:13:00.010
He said that he saw Thaegan's children earlier. So, he flew here as fast as he could, thinking that we were in danger.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:07.110
If Kree could get in here, then that means...

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:18.310
It's the rainbow!

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:20.880
We might be able to get out from here!

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:24.510
I see! So only the chimney is
connected to the outside, then.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:27.900
Nice work, Kree!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:01.440
Seems like that lot aren't around...

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:02.960
Okay. Now's our chance!

00:14:14.530 --> 00:14:15.650
What's wrong, Lief?

00:14:18.060 --> 00:14:19.220
It's them.

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:21.980
Will Mama be happy with this?

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:26.200
Of course she will! We gathered this
many of her favourite bird, after all!

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:31.180
Then, I wonder if she will let us
feast on those three as a reward?

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:34.620
It's such a waste to just trap them in and let them rot!

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:36.750
I really want to eat them!!

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.710
Keep resisting and I'll eat you all right now!

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:55.490
Oh no! Mama is going to be really angry at us!!

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:02.610
You're not getting away, now!

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:05.400
We had just gathered those for Mama!

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:06.470
Kree!

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:12.450
Ah, it's them! They escaped from the mansion?!

00:15:12.530 --> 00:15:13.150
Not good!

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:13.900
Let's run!

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:14.850
Kree!

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:16.600
As if we'll let you!

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.910
Mama will be really mad at us if we let them go!!

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:21.080
Mama! Mama!

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:36.960
Our delicious food is getting away!

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:38.300
I want to eat them!!

00:15:58.460 --> 00:15:59.800
Here as well, huh...

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:04.590
You can't escape now!

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:06.090
It's a dead-end for you!

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:07.800
These guys...!

00:16:11.020 --> 00:16:13.110
Let's eat...!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.300
Let's eat!

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:15.800
Let's eat!

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:38.980
You aren't going anywhere.

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:42.740
So that bird we saw before was Thaegan?!

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:46.540
Rae Exalaedus, Thaegan!

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:57.010
Keep running like the fools that you are!

00:16:57.100 --> 00:16:58.290
I won't run from you!

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:11.500
Mama...

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:12.920
Became two...!

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:13.830
How?!

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:25.110
That's impossible!

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:26.310
Is this another illusion?!

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:44.020
There are so many Mamas now!

00:17:44.020 --> 00:17:47.350
I'm happy that we have a lot of
Mamas now, but it's a little scary...

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:51.300
Rae Exalaedus, Imu Dominum Sedolak...!

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:52.910
Oh no! Everyone, get in!

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:55.000
Thaegan!

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:10.800
I'm not permitted to allow you three to leave this
mansion; it's the will of the Shadow Lord, you see.

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:15.200
There is nothing more we can
do now than just sit tight...

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:19.730
You'll be able to live for a lot longer if you just remain inside the mansion.

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:23.150
But since you're so willing to die,
allow me to burn you all to charcoal!

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:24.800
Yay! It's a party tonight!

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:26.720
I want a well-done one!

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:28.720
Let's eat them! Let's eat them!!

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:32.700
At this rate, we really will be killed...

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:33.900
What can we do...?

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:42.300
The lapis lazuli is...!

00:18:54.970 --> 00:18:59.950
<i>According to the Book of Deltora, the lapis lazuli has the power to ward off evil.</i>

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:06.800
<i>And when a star shines in the sky, it's said that its true power will be exerted.</i>

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:28.540
M-My body... is...

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:34.580
Mama...!

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:37.810
Mama has turned into a grandma...!

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:44.700
This is all the doing of that accursed lapis lazuli, isn't it?! If only such a stone didn't exist...!

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:48.400
Thaegan...!

00:20:08.110 --> 00:20:09.720
M-My children...!

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:17.810
You bastards...!

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:21.000
The power of the belt has revealed it to me...

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:24.900
Your weakness is that magic ring on your finger!!

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:28.850
Even if you know, what are <i>you</i> going to do about it?!

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:30.030
Die!

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:32.300
Rae Exa...

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:33.520
Thae-...!!

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:35.190
The belt has saved us again.

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:41.870
Kree.

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:48.500
You really did a great job today, Kree!

00:21:56.400 --> 00:21:58.410
This cave isn't the one either...!

00:21:58.410 --> 00:22:01.610
Just which cave was connected
to the other side anyway?!

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:05.710
Somehow, I ended up forgetting
which caves we had and hadn't tried.

00:22:05.910 --> 00:22:10.000
We should have just asked about the shortcut to Dread Mountain first.

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:11.610
It's too late to be saying that now...

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:17.920
Alright, let's try that cave this time!

00:22:35.490 --> 00:22:40.290
Every moment is a gate to fantasia

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:47.670
You just do it to be an shining star

00:22:47.670 --> 00:22:48.380
Uh la la!

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:51.050
On nights when a gentle breeze caresses your cheek
柔らかな風頬撫でる夕方
Yawaraka na kaze hoho naderu yuugata

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:53.550
And you start walking with your head held high
もし君が上向き歩き出すなら
Moshi kimi ga uemuki arukidasu nara

00:22:53.550 --> 00:22:57.680
You might just be blessed by the big red sun
大きな赤い太陽が君を祝福してくれるだろう
Ooki na akai taiyou ga kimi o shukufuku shite kureru darou

00:22:57.930 --> 00:23:00.310
When hardships cause you to stumble
何かにつまずき打ちひしがれて
Nanika ni tsumazuki uchihishigarete

00:23:00.560 --> 00:23:02.770
And you keep hanging your head in shame
もし君がうつむいたままなら
Moshi kimi ga utsumuita mama nara

00:23:03.020 --> 00:23:05.020
Just know that you may end up missing out on that one emotional scene
その感動的なワンシーン
Sono kandouteki na wanshiin

00:23:05.020 --> 00:23:05.230
Just know that you may end up missing out on that one emotional scene

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:07.780
逃してしまうかも知れないから
